{"storyMeta":{"storyReviewType":"NONE","storyId":"main_15_level_st_15-03","storyGroup":"main_15","storySort":235,"storyDependence":"main_15_level_st_15-03","storyCanShow":0,"storyCode":"15-21","storyName":"大地与一隅的归宿","storyPic":null,"storyInfo":"罗德岛开始了漫长的重建任务，而Mon3tr也从未放弃寻找将凯尔希带回来的办法。本已崩解死去的卡特斯感染者重新回到了泰拉大地，也带来了完全超过她想象的变化。","storyCanEnter":1,"storyTxt":"obt/main/level_st_15-03","avgTag":"幕间","unLockType":"STAGE_CLEAR","costItemType":"NONE","costItemId":null,"costItemCount":0,"stageCount":1,"requiredStages":[{"stageId":"st_15-03","minState":"PLAYED","maxState":"COMPLETE"}],"prev":23,"characters":["热情的声音","阿兰娜","医疗干员","红","华法琳","希尔达","普瑞赛斯","远处的声音","采矿工人","急性感染的工人","阿米娅","Mon3tr","萨卡兹佣兵","奥伦","萨卡兹雇佣兵"]},"lines":[{"type":"header","key":"title_test","skippable":"true","mode":"BLACK_MASK","id":0},{"type":"stopmusic","id":1},{"type":"dialog","id":2},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":3},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":4},{"type":"charslot","id":5},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/a/a2/Avg_bg_bg_rhodeslounge.png","screenadapt":"coverall","id":6},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_crwddiscuss_inside","channel":"cr","loop":"true","volume":"0","id":7},{"type":"soundvolume","volume":"1","channel":"cr","fadetime":"2","id":8},{"type":"playmusic","key":"https://static.prts.wiki/music/music/avg/m_avg_comedy_loop.mp3","volume":"0.6","id":9,"musicid":0},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":10},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":11},{"type":"stopsound","channel":"cr","fadetime":"4","id":12},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_501_1#1$1","duration":"0.5","isblock":"true","id":13},{"type":"multiline","name":"医疗干员","text":"综合报告厅的位置在......","id":14},{"type":"multiline","name":"医疗干员","end":"true","text":"咦？不是这里吗？","id":15},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","focus":"n","id":16},{"type":"dialogue","name":"热情的声音","text":"你也回来了？！","id":17},{"type":"dialog","id":18},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_gen_walk_n","volume":"1","id":19},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_4178_alanna_1#1$1","posfrom":"-200,0","posto":"0,0","duration":"1.5","isblock":"true","id":20},{"type":"delay","time":"0.5","id":21},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_4178_alanna_1#1$1","focus":"l","id":22},{"type":"dialogue","name":"阿兰娜","text":"报告厅在这边，跟我来吧！","id":23},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_501_1#1$1","focus":"r","id":24},{"type":"dialogue","name":"医疗干员","text":"我收到了本舰信使传来的消息，就赶紧回来了。","id":25,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/c5/Avg_avg_npc_501_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"医疗干员","text":"好多人......大伙都回来了呀......","id":26,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/c5/Avg_avg_npc_501_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_4178_alanna_1#1$1","focus":"l","id":27},{"type":"dialogue","name":"阿兰娜","text":"是呀，本舰的内部结构一直在优化，但大伙还是经常会迷路。","id":28},{"type":"dialogue","name":"阿兰娜","text":"我们已经印制了指引标识，等会儿就贴上去。","id":29},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_501_1#1$1","focus":"r","id":30},{"type":"dialogue","name":"医疗干员","text":"一开始知道总部搬到了移动地块上我还不敢相信......我也没有权限去查阅那场变故具体发生了什么。","id":31,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/c5/Avg_avg_npc_501_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"医疗干员","text":"听说是遭遇了源石的异变，好在当时留舰的同事们做了紧急处理，才全都撤了出来。","id":32,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/c5/Avg_avg_npc_501_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_4178_alanna_1#9$1","focus":"l","id":33},{"type":"dialogue","name":"阿兰娜","text":"哈，没什么好担心的。博士不是说过吗，我们会把原本那艘给重新清理出来的。","id":34},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_501_1#1$1","focus":"r","id":35},{"type":"dialogue","name":"医疗干员","text":"嗯......来的路上，我遇见了阿米娅，还特意询问了凯尔希医生的情况。","id":36,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/c5/Avg_avg_npc_501_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"医疗干员","text":"她没有细说，也特意安慰我不要担心——","id":37,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/c5/Avg_avg_npc_501_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"医疗干员","text":"明明是我想先安慰她来着......","id":38,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/c5/Avg_avg_npc_501_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":39},{"type":"charslot","id":40},{"type":"musicvolume","volume":"0.2","fadetime":"2","id":41},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"char_144_red_7#3","duration":"0.5","isblock":"true","id":42},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":43},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","focus":"n","id":44},{"type":"text","text":"红依旧抱有期望。","id":45},{"type":"text","text":"她远远藏在暗处，口袋里依旧装着保存她乳牙的袋子。","id":46},{"type":"text","text":"红本想在凯尔希回来时偷偷塞进她的口袋，但回来的是另一个人。","id":47},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"char_144_red_7#4","id":48},{"type":"dialogue","name":"红","text":"......","id":49,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/50/Avg_char_144_red_4.png"},{"type":"charslot","id":50},{"type":"text","text":"她期待今天听到凯尔希的消息，她知道博士和Mon3tr一直在秘密研究些什么。","id":51},{"type":"dialog","id":52},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_crwddiscuss_inside","channel":"cr","loop":"true","volume":"0","id":53},{"type":"soundvolume","volume":"0.5","channel":"cr","fadetime":"2","id":54},{"type":"stopmusic","fadetime":"2","id":55},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":56},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"1","block":"true","id":57},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":58},{"type":"stopsound","channel":"cr","fadetime":"2","id":59},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":60},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_gen_walk_n","volume":"1","id":61},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_171_bldsk_1#9$1","duration":"1.5","isblock":"true","id":62},{"type":"delay","time":"0.5","id":63},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","focus":"n","id":64},{"type":"dialogue","name":"医疗干员","text":"嗯，呃......华法琳医生？不是说这次来分享的人是博士吗？","id":65},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_171_bldsk_1#9$1","id":66},{"type":"dialogue","name":"华法琳","text":"这么紧张干嘛？","id":67,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/7f/Avg_avg_171_bldsk_1-9$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"华法琳","text":"只是简单的医疗部论文分享而已。","id":68,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/7f/Avg_avg_171_bldsk_1-9$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_171_bldsk_1#1$1","id":69},{"type":"dialogue","name":"华法琳","text":"Dr.{@nickname}有更重要的事情抽不开身。而且也没有比我更合适的人了。","id":70,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/cb/Avg_avg_171_bldsk_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"playmusic","intro":"$newhope01_intro","key":"https://static.prts.wiki/music/music/beta3_181101/m_dia_newhope01_loop.mp3","volume":"0.6","id":71,"musicid":1},{"type":"dialogue","name":"华法琳","text":"这篇重要论文的其中一位作者就是我的病人，她叫克洛伊。","id":72,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/cb/Avg_avg_171_bldsk_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"华法琳","text":"在不久前罗德岛所遭遇的那场意外中，她协助我们完成了一项至关重要的矿石病研究。","id":73,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/cb/Avg_avg_171_bldsk_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"华法琳","text":"这项研究不仅在当时帮我们改变了局势，也注定会在未来警示每个关注矿石病演变的医疗工作者。","id":74,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/cb/Avg_avg_171_bldsk_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"华法琳","text":"每次开始分享前，我们总是会详细地介绍每一位作者。他们的履历，他们的成果......","id":75,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/cb/Avg_avg_171_bldsk_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_171_bldsk_1#8$1","id":76},{"type":"dialogue","name":"华法琳","text":"但当我想要详细地介绍克洛伊时，我却不知道从何说起。","id":77,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/44/Avg_avg_171_bldsk_1-8$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"华法琳","text":"她的经历很苍白，并且在我照顾她的三年里，我甚至没有兴趣去深入了解她的过往。","id":78,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/44/Avg_avg_171_bldsk_1-8$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_171_bldsk_1#1$1","id":79},{"type":"dialogue","name":"华法琳","text":"在注释里，我给她留下的文字也只有寥寥数笔——","id":80,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/cb/Avg_avg_171_bldsk_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"华法琳","text":"一个维多利亚的感染者，不那么喜欢乖乖听主治医生的医嘱，喜欢用手工制作的小钟在病房里制造些难听的噪音......","id":81,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/cb/Avg_avg_171_bldsk_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"华法琳","text":"她也是本次实验中首个提出关键假设并提供了珍贵样本的研究主导人员。至于样本——","id":82,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/cb/Avg_avg_171_bldsk_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_171_bldsk_1#5$1","id":83},{"type":"dialogue","name":"华法琳","text":"就是她自己。","id":84,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/a/a5/Avg_avg_171_bldsk_1-5$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"华法琳","text":"......她请求我伤害她，并结合她的客观变化来得出更准确的数据。","id":85,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/a/a5/Avg_avg_171_bldsk_1-5$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":86},{"type":"charslot","id":87},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_crwddiscuss_inside","channel":"cr","loop":"true","volume":"0","id":88},{"type":"soundvolume","volume":"0.6","channel":"cr","fadetime":"1","id":89},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":90},{"type":"stopsound","channel":"cr","fadetime":"4","id":91},{"type":"text","text":"许多前来参与分享会的干员都鲜有见过如此严肃的华法琳医生。","id":92},{"type":"text","text":"原本在发现分享人是她之后，部分人有过悄悄溜走的念头。","id":93},{"type":"text","text":"但最终没有一个人离开。他们尊重克洛伊的牺牲，也同样在乎那场意外中，罗德岛到底经历了什么。","id":94},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_171_bldsk_1#8$1","id":95},{"type":"dialogue","name":"华法琳","text":"作为她的医生，我并不支持她的决定。","id":96,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/44/Avg_avg_171_bldsk_1-8$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_171_bldsk_1#1$1","id":97},{"type":"dialogue","name":"华法琳","text":"但作为罗德岛的成员，我感激她帮助罗德岛的勇气——","id":98,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/cb/Avg_avg_171_bldsk_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":99},{"type":"musicvolume","volume":"0.2","fadetime":"2","id":100},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":101},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":102},{"type":"charslot","id":103},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/50/Avg_bg_60_g3_cvilizationtombstone.png","screenadapt":"coverall","id":104},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":105},{"type":"blocker","a":"0.6","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":106},{"type":"subtitle","text":"“作为最特殊的病人，她也许有机会摆脱矿石病的绝望......以另一种方式继续生存下去。”","x":"300","y":"350","alignment":"center","size":"24","delay":"0.04","width":"700","id":107},{"type":"subtitle","text":"“也许，她本可以从死亡的身边逃离。”","x":"300","y":"350","alignment":"center","size":"24","delay":"0.04","width":"700","id":108},{"type":"subtitle","id":109},{"type":"musicvolume","volume":"0.6","fadetime":"2","id":110},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"1","block":"false","id":111},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_1718_1#2$1","duration":"1","id":112},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":113},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_universe_fts","volume":"1","loop":"true","channel":"u","id":114},{"type":"stopsound","channel":"u","fadetime":"3","id":115},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_1719_1#1$1","duration":"1.5","isblock":"true","id":116},{"type":"delay","time":"0.5","id":117},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_1719_1#1$1","focus":"r","id":118},{"type":"dialogue","name":"希尔达","text":"我，我已经做好了决定......","id":119,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/df/Avg_avg_npc_1719_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_1718_1#2$1","focus":"l","id":120},{"type":"dialogue","name":"普瑞赛斯","text":"还是想要回去，回到属于你的那片大地？","id":121,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/52/Avg_avg_npc_1718_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_1719_1#1$1","focus":"r","id":122},{"type":"dialogue","name":"希尔达","text":"是的。","id":123,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/df/Avg_avg_npc_1719_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_1718_1#2$1","focus":"l","id":124},{"type":"dialogue","name":"普瑞赛斯","text":"那意味着你终将再次面对死亡。","id":125,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/52/Avg_avg_npc_1718_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_1719_1#11$1","focus":"r","id":126},{"type":"dialogue","name":"希尔达","text":"死亡本就是所有生命的终点。","id":127,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/fe/Avg_avg_npc_1719_1-11$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"希尔达","text":"我已经在这里见到了许多我无法想象的“神明”，他们也教会了我许多。","id":128,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/fe/Avg_avg_npc_1719_1-11$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"希尔达","text":"我想回去告诉我的同胞......","id":129,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/fe/Avg_avg_npc_1719_1-11$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"希尔达","text":"尽管终点已经注定，他们也不必生活在害怕崩解，害怕死亡的恐惧中。","id":130,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/fe/Avg_avg_npc_1719_1-11$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"希尔达","text":"也许，我能找到办法消弭源石带给他们的恐惧。","id":131,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/fe/Avg_avg_npc_1719_1-11$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_1718_1#2$1","focus":"l","id":132},{"type":"dialogue","name":"普瑞赛斯","text":"这就是你想要的全部？","id":133,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/52/Avg_avg_npc_1718_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_1719_1#11$1","focus":"r","id":134},{"type":"dialogue","name":"希尔达","text":"是的。","id":135,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/fe/Avg_avg_npc_1719_1-11$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","focus":"n","id":136},{"type":"text","text":"卡特斯坚定地看着普瑞赛斯，然后她眼中那位创造了许多奇迹的人拉起了她的手。","id":137},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_1718_1#1$1","focus":"l","id":138},{"type":"dialogue","name":"普瑞赛斯","text":"那就跟我一起离开吧。","id":139,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/b/b2/Avg_avg_npc_1718_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"普瑞赛斯","text":"我会送你回家。","id":140,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/b/b2/Avg_avg_npc_1718_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_1719_1#4$1","focus":"r","id":141},{"type":"dialogue","name":"希尔达","text":"......","id":142,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/4a/Avg_avg_npc_1719_1-4$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_1718_1#1$1","focus":"l","id":143},{"type":"dialogue","name":"普瑞赛斯","text":"你在这里还有留恋的东西吗？","id":144,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/b/b2/Avg_avg_npc_1718_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","focus":"n","id":145},{"type":"text","text":"卡特斯摇了摇头。","id":146},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_1719_1#10$1","focus":"r","id":147},{"type":"dialogue","name":"希尔达","text":"以后，我还能再见到您吗？","id":148,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/b/bd/Avg_avg_npc_1719_1-10$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_1718_1#8$1","focus":"l","id":149},{"type":"dialogue","name":"普瑞赛斯","text":"我不是预言家，没法看见你的未来。","id":150,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/f7/Avg_avg_npc_1718_1-8$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":151},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_universe_fts","volume":"1","loop":"true","channel":"u","id":152},{"type":"stopsound","channel":"u","fadetime":"3","id":153},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","afrom":"1","ato":"0","duration":"1.5","id":154},{"type":"delay","time":"0.5","id":155},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","afrom":"1","ato":"0","duration":"1.5","id":156},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":157},{"type":"text","text":"普瑞赛斯拉着卡特斯的手走进了那庞大构造的阴影之中。","id":158},{"type":"text","text":"她们走向了无数文明沉默的终点，走向了孕育着新希望的起点。","id":159},{"type":"dialog","id":160},{"type":"musicvolume","volume":"0.2","fadetime":"2","id":161},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":162},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":163},{"type":"charslot","id":164},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/cf/Avg_bg_bg_labentrance.png","screenadapt":"coverall","id":165},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":166},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_snowstormflp","volume":"0","loop":"true","channel":"sn","id":167},{"type":"soundvolume","volume":"1","channel":"sn","fadetime":"2","id":168},{"type":"blocker","a":"0.6","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":169},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":170},{"type":"subtitle","text":"“......而在我们共同的研究之中，其中一个关键的结论已经得到了充分的验证。”","x":"300","y":"350","alignment":"center","size":"24","delay":"0.04","width":"700","id":171},{"type":"subtitle","text":"“源石正在发生某种我们暂时无法解明的变化，而这种变化已经开始对我们的患者产生连锁效应。”","x":"300","y":"350","alignment":"center","size":"24","delay":"0.04","width":"700","id":172},{"type":"subtitle","text":"“自三年前维多利亚的那场大面积感染事件发生后，我们首次证实了矿石病的新病征的存在。”","x":"300","y":"350","alignment":"center","size":"24","delay":"0.04","width":"700","id":173},{"type":"subtitle","text":"“这必然会为今后泰拉的矿石病防治研究带来全新的方向，可至于是好是坏......我们还需要更多的案例和数据。”","x":"300","y":"350","alignment":"center","size":"24","delay":"0.04","width":"700","id":174},{"type":"subtitle","id":175},{"type":"musicvolume","volume":"0.6","fadetime":"2","id":176},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"1","block":"false","id":177},{"type":"stopsound","channel":"sn","fadetime":"2","id":178},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_gen_walk_n","volume":"1","id":179},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1719_1#1$1","duration":"1.5","isblock":"true","id":180},{"type":"delay","time":"0.5","id":181},{"type":"dialogue","name":"希尔达","text":"......？","id":182,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/df/Avg_avg_npc_1719_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","focus":"n","id":183},{"type":"text","text":"当卡特斯的眼睛从黑暗中重新适应光亮的时候，她已经嗅到了风沙裹挟而来的味道。","id":184},{"type":"text","text":"她毫不质疑，这里是她的泰拉。她已经回到了家。","id":185},{"type":"text","text":"她还能感受到掌心里的温度，可这里只剩她一人。","id":186},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1719_1#10$1","id":187},{"type":"dialogue","name":"希尔达","text":"您......走了。","id":188,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/b/bd/Avg_avg_npc_1719_1-10$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","id":189},{"type":"dialogue","name":"远处的声音","text":"这片荒地上居然还有其他人——","id":190},{"type":"dialogue","name":"远处的声音","text":"......向她求援......她看上去比我们还脆弱......","id":191},{"type":"dialogue","name":"远处的声音","text":"疼，我知道那很疼......我会去帮你找到救助的，等着我......坚持住......","id":192},{"type":"text","text":"卡特斯看到了一个人慌张地向她跑来。","id":193},{"type":"dialog","id":194},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_1719_1#1$1","id":195},{"type":"delay","time":"0.5","id":196},{"type":"playsound","key":"$rungeneral","volume":"1","id":197},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_1186_1#1$1","posfrom":"-200,0","posto":"0,0","duration":"1.5","isblock":"true","id":198},{"type":"delay","time":"0.5","id":199},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_1186_1#1$1","focus":"l","id":200},{"type":"dialogue","name":"采矿工人","text":"你，你好，请问能否帮我们联系最近地块上的医院——不，不，那样来不及——","id":201,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/e/ed/Avg_avg_npc_1186_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":202},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","afrom":"1","ato":"1","posfrom":"0,0","posto":"80,0","duration":"0.5","isblock":"true","id":203},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","focus":"l","id":204},{"type":"dialogue","name":"采矿工人","text":"或者你身上恰好带了抑制剂......看上去，你也是感染者......","id":205},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","focus":"n","id":206},{"type":"text","text":"采矿工人慌张地拉住了希尔达的手，就像抓住了最后的一丝希望。","id":207},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_1719_1#10$1","focus":"r","id":208},{"type":"dialogue","name":"希尔达","text":"......","id":209,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/b/bd/Avg_avg_npc_1719_1-10$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","focus":"n","id":210},{"type":"text","text":"她没有抑制剂，也并不知道如何才能联系上最近的医院——","id":211},{"type":"text","text":"可她不愿意就此掐灭同胞的希望。","id":212},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_1719_1#2$1","focus":"r","id":213},{"type":"dialogue","name":"希尔达","text":"你遇上了什么麻烦？可以带我过去吗？","id":214,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/74/Avg_avg_npc_1719_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"希尔达","text":"也许我能帮上忙。","id":215,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/74/Avg_avg_npc_1719_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","focus":"n","id":216},{"type":"text","text":"也许。","id":217},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_1186_1#1$1","focus":"l","id":218},{"type":"dialogue","name":"采矿工人","text":"谢谢你！谢谢你！","id":219,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/e/ed/Avg_avg_npc_1186_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"采矿工人","text":"我的哥哥就在那边！","id":220,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/e/ed/Avg_avg_npc_1186_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":221},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_walkfast","volume":"1","id":222},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_1186_1#1$1","posfrom":"80,0","posto":"-220,0","afrom":"1","ato":"0","duration":"1","id":223},{"type":"delay","time":"0.6","id":224},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_1719_1#2$1","posfrom":"0,0","posto":"-300,0","afrom":"1","ato":"0","duration":"2","id":225},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":226},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":227},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","style":"slider","inverse":"true","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":228},{"type":"charslot","id":229},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/b/b9/Avg_bg_bg_laccolith.png","screenadapt":"coverall","id":230},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","style":"slider","inverse":"true","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":231},{"type":"text","text":"她们快步地向前走去，绕过阻挡了视线的山丘之后，眼前的景象却让希尔达呆住了。","id":232},{"type":"text","text":"在一道巨大的裂谷中，一簇巨大的源石结晶卡在崖壁之间。","id":233},{"type":"text","text":"透过厚厚的晶体，希尔达似乎能看到晶簇之中还封存着某个庞然大物。","id":234},{"type":"text","text":"一艘舰船？","id":235},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_1186_1#1$1","focus":"n","id":236},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_1719_1#9$1","focus":"r","id":237},{"type":"dialogue","name":"希尔达","text":"那，到底是......什么？","id":238,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/40/Avg_avg_npc_1719_1-9$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_1186_1#1$1","focus":"l","id":239},{"type":"dialogue","name":"采矿工人","text":"我们在这碰巧发现了一处新矿脉，本想趁注册登记前先开采一点试试——","id":240,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/e/ed/Avg_avg_npc_1186_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"采矿工人","text":"毕竟它成色太好了，而，而且里面说不定还有些更值钱的东西......","id":241,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/e/ed/Avg_avg_npc_1186_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"采矿工人","text":"但谁知道这里会这么邪门！不光好像有什么东西盯着我们，哥哥还因为意外受伤而急性感染——","id":242,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/e/ed/Avg_avg_npc_1186_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":243},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","focus":"n","id":244},{"type":"dialogue","name":"急性感染的工人","text":"（痛苦地哀嚎）","id":245},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_1719_1#9$1","focus":"r","id":246},{"type":"dialogue","name":"希尔达","text":"症状很严重。你应该清楚，他快要崩解了......我没有办法。","id":247,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/40/Avg_avg_npc_1719_1-9$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_1186_1#1$1","focus":"l","id":248},{"type":"dialogue","name":"采矿工人","text":"我，我不能就这么抛下他。家里还有十三个兄弟姐妹在等我们回去——","id":249,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/e/ed/Avg_avg_npc_1186_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_1719_1#7$1","focus":"r","id":250},{"type":"dialogue","name":"希尔达","text":"听我说，你必须马上离开，离得越远越好。","id":251,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/b/bc/Avg_avg_npc_1719_1-7$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_1186_1#1$1","focus":"l","id":252},{"type":"dialogue","name":"采矿工人","text":"可，可......","id":253,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/e/ed/Avg_avg_npc_1186_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_1719_1#8$1","focus":"r","id":254},{"type":"dialogue","name":"希尔达","text":"别回头，我的同胞。走。","id":255,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/43/Avg_avg_npc_1719_1-8$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"希尔达","text":"我处理过这样的情况，交给我。","id":256,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/43/Avg_avg_npc_1719_1-8$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","focus":"n","id":257},{"type":"dialogue","name":"急性感染的工人","text":"（艰难地说话）......走......","id":258},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_1186_1#1$1","focus":"l","id":259},{"type":"dialogue","name":"采矿工人","text":"......","id":260,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/e/ed/Avg_avg_npc_1186_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":261},{"type":"playsound","key":"$rungeneral","volume":"1","id":262},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","posfrom":"0,0","posto":"-200,0","afrom":"1","ato":"0","duration":"0.8","id":263},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":264},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_1719_1#1$1","posfrom":"0,0","posto":"-200,0","afrom":"1","ato":"1","duration":"1.5","isblock":"true","id":265},{"type":"dialogue","name":"希尔达","text":"我理解你的痛苦，也知道当光从我们的眼睛中消失时的恐慌......","id":266,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/df/Avg_avg_npc_1719_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"希尔达","text":"我也曾经历过。","id":267,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/df/Avg_avg_npc_1719_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","focus":"n","id":268},{"type":"dialogue","name":"急性感染的工人","text":"（震惊地呢喃）","id":269},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_1719_1#3$1","focus":"r","id":270},{"type":"dialogue","name":"希尔达","text":"我能做的，唯有陪伴你走到终点之前。","id":271,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/94/Avg_avg_npc_1719_1-3$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","focus":"n","id":272},{"type":"text","text":"卡特斯握住了将死之人已经僵硬的手，试图给予他最后一丝温暖。","id":273},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_1719_1#3$1","focus":"r","id":274},{"type":"dialogue","name":"希尔达","text":"愿你的痛苦更少一些，我的同胞。","id":275,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/94/Avg_avg_npc_1719_1-3$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","focus":"n","id":276},{"type":"dialogue","name":"急性感染的工人","text":"疼痛，不，不见了......","id":277},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_1719_1#9$1","focus":"r","id":278},{"type":"dialogue","name":"希尔达","text":"......？！","id":279,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/40/Avg_avg_npc_1719_1-9$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","id":280},{"type":"text","text":"卡特斯并不明白发生了什么，明明那些石头仍然在将死之人的身上蔓延。","id":281},{"type":"text","text":"但那些黑色石子却渐渐变得越来越纯净，甚至开始闪耀着橙色的光芒。","id":282},{"type":"dialogue","name":"急性感染的工人","text":"你，怎么做到的——？！","id":283},{"type":"dialog","id":284},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_clothmovement","volume":"1","id":285},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1731_1#1$1","posfrom":"0,-20","posto":"0,0","duration":"1.5","isblock":"true","id":286},{"type":"delay","time":"0.5","id":287},{"type":"dialogue","name":"急性感染的工人","text":"它们不再让我感到疼痛了，为什么......","id":288,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/88/Avg_avg_npc_1731_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","focus":"n","id":289},{"type":"text","text":"处于震惊中的人活动着自己的身体，发现自己就和没有遭遇意外时一模一样——","id":290},{"type":"text","text":"除了那些仍然在缓慢生长的源石。","id":291},{"type":"text","text":"终有一天，他或许全身都将被源石所取代......","id":292},{"type":"text","text":"等到那一天到来的时候，他又会变成什么样呢？","id":293},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1731_1#1$1","id":294},{"type":"dialogue","name":"急性感染的工人","text":"我感觉身体在恢复，不可思议......","id":295,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/88/Avg_avg_npc_1731_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"急性感染的工人","text":"我，摆脱了死亡？","id":296,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/88/Avg_avg_npc_1731_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","id":297},{"type":"text","text":"他茫然地看着眼前这位卡特斯少女，却发现她的眼中同样充满了震惊。","id":298},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1719_1#9$1","id":299},{"type":"dialogue","name":"希尔达","text":"——是您满足了我的愿望？还是......？","id":300,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/40/Avg_avg_npc_1719_1-9$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":301},{"type":"charslot","id":302},{"type":"delay","time":"1.5","id":303},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4132_ascln_1#1$1","bstart":"0.2","bend":"0.7","duration":"1","id":304},{"type":"delay","time":"1.5","id":305},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","focus":"n","id":306},{"type":"text","text":"她并未看到她想要见到的那个人，而是捕捉到了站在山崖之巅远远看着她的身影。","id":307},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1719_1#9$1","id":308},{"type":"dialogue","name":"希尔达","text":"......","id":309,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/40/Avg_avg_npc_1719_1-9$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","id":310},{"type":"text","text":"随后，远处看着他们的人转身离开了。","id":311},{"type":"dialog","id":312},{"type":"stopmusic","fadetime":"2","id":313},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":314},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":315},{"type":"charslot","id":316},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/a/a2/Avg_bg_bg_rhodeslounge.png","screenadapt":"coverall","id":317},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_171_bldsk_1#1$1","id":318},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":319},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":320},{"type":"dialogue","name":"华法琳","text":"——这篇论文对我自己而言，也意味着很多东西。","id":321,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/cb/Avg_avg_171_bldsk_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"华法琳","text":"是克洛伊的坚持再一次提醒了我罗德岛为何而存在，也提醒了我凯尔希为何坚持我们的道路。","id":322,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/cb/Avg_avg_171_bldsk_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_171_bldsk_1#5$1","id":323},{"type":"dialogue","name":"华法琳","text":"不同于曾经的任何一个时期，如今的罗德岛是一家试图解决矿石病带来的痛苦的医药公司——","id":324,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/a/a5/Avg_avg_171_bldsk_1-5$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"华法琳","text":"也必须是一家试图解决源石问题的医药公司。","id":325,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/a/a5/Avg_avg_171_bldsk_1-5$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"华法琳","text":"我们为那些绝望的人带去了希望，他们也愿意用希望回报我们。","id":326,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/a/a5/Avg_avg_171_bldsk_1-5$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_171_bldsk_1#8$1","id":327},{"type":"dialogue","name":"华法琳","text":"这一篇论文，是罗德岛送给克洛伊的致敬，也是我们的一份承诺——","id":328,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/44/Avg_avg_171_bldsk_1-8$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_171_bldsk_1#5$1","id":329},{"type":"dialogue","name":"华法琳","text":"——给凯尔希的承诺。","id":330,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/a/a5/Avg_avg_171_bldsk_1-5$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":331},{"type":"charslot","id":332},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_applause","volume":"1","id":333},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":334},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_crwddiscuss_inside","channel":"cr","loop":"true","volume":"0","id":335},{"type":"soundvolume","volume":"1","channel":"cr","fadetime":"2","id":336},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":337},{"type":"stopsound","channel":"cr","fadetime":"2","id":338},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":339},{"type":"playmusic","intro":"$warm_intro","key":"https://static.prts.wiki/music/music/act9d0d0/m_avg_warm_loop.mp3","volume":"0.6","id":340,"musicid":2},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_walkfast","volume":"1","id":341},{"type":"text","text":"你在华法琳演讲结束之后，才终于赶到了这里。","id":342},{"type":"dialog","id":343},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","focus":"n","id":344},{"type":"decision","options":{"1":{"id":"346","text":"感谢你替我完成了这次分享。"}},"values":[],"id":345},{"type":"predicate","references":["1"],"id":346},{"type":"decision","options":{"1":{"id":"348","text":"克洛伊是一位可敬的人。"}},"values":[],"id":347},{"type":"predicate","references":["1"],"id":348},{"type":"decision","options":{"1":{"id":"350","text":"一位拯救了医生的病人。"}},"values":[],"id":349},{"type":"predicate","references":["1"],"id":350,"end":352},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_171_bldsk_1#1$1","id":351},{"type":"dialogue","name":"华法琳","text":"你那边结束了？看上去你挺开心。","id":352,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/cb/Avg_avg_171_bldsk_1-1$1.png","end":true},{"type":"dialog","id":353},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","focus":"n","id":354},{"type":"decision","options":{"1":{"id":"356","text":"我们这里同样有些进展。"}},"values":[],"id":355},{"type":"predicate","references":["1"],"id":356,"end":361},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1037_amiya3_1#8$2","id":357},{"type":"dialogue","name":"阿米娅","text":"是的，华法琳医生。","id":358,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/81/Avg_avg_1037_amiya3_1-8$2.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"阿米娅","text":"幸好有Mon3tr的协助，我们从凯尔希医生留下的诸多数据里找到了一些关键信息。","id":359,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/81/Avg_avg_1037_amiya3_1-8$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_171_bldsk_1#10$1","id":360},{"type":"dialogue","name":"华法琳","text":"你们的意思是......？！","id":361,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/e/ea/Avg_avg_171_bldsk_1-10$1.png","end":true},{"type":"dialog","id":362},{"type":"charslot","id":363},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","focus":"n","id":364},{"type":"decision","options":{"1":{"id":"366","text":"让Mon3tr亲口告诉你这个消息吧。"}},"values":[],"id":365},{"type":"predicate","references":["1"],"id":366,"end":383},{"type":"playsound","key":"$rungeneral","volume":"1","id":367},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4179_monstr_1#11$1","posfrom":"-200,0","posto":"0,0","duration":"0.8","isblock":"true","id":368},{"type":"delay","time":"0.5","id":369},{"type":"dialogue","name":"Mon3tr","text":"华法琳医生！我找到办法了！","id":370},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4179_monstr_1#10$1","id":371},{"type":"dialogue","name":"Mon3tr","text":"虽然我和她之间的联系已经切断了，但是我的大脑里还储存着她基本的生命识别信号和神经元数据。","id":372},{"type":"dialogue","name":"Mon3tr","text":"再加上我之前一直和她共享的思维网络，理论上只需要一台足够功率的大型生命维持装置，我们就能把她——","id":373},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_171_bldsk_1#10$1","id":374},{"type":"dialogue","name":"华法琳","text":"等等等等，慢一点！你到底想说什么？","id":375,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/e/ea/Avg_avg_171_bldsk_1-10$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4179_monstr_1#10$1","id":376},{"type":"dialogue","name":"Mon3tr","text":"我是说，虽然只是理论上的可能性......","id":377},{"type":"dialogue","name":"Mon3tr","text":"如果我们可以借助石棺的力量......","id":378},{"type":"dialogue","name":"Mon3tr","text":"我们就有可能将凯尔希带回来！","id":379},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_171_bldsk_1#9$1","id":380},{"type":"dialogue","name":"华法琳","text":"我就知道凯尔希那家伙没这么容易......","id":381,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/7f/Avg_avg_171_bldsk_1-9$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_171_bldsk_1#10$1","id":382},{"type":"dialogue","name":"华法琳","text":"可是，石棺？曾经在罗德岛上的那个装置？","id":383,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/e/ea/Avg_avg_171_bldsk_1-10$1.png","end":true},{"type":"dialog","id":384},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","focus":"n","id":385},{"type":"decision","options":{"1":{"id":"387","text":"我们暂时回不去罗德岛了。"},"2":{"id":"387","text":"现在我们还有可能接触到的石棺只有一个。"}},"values":[],"id":386},{"type":"predicate","references":["1","2"],"id":387},{"type":"decision","options":{"1":{"id":"389","text":"乌萨斯。"}},"values":[],"id":388},{"type":"predicate","references":["1"],"id":389,"end":396},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1037_amiya3_1#6$2","id":390},{"type":"dialogue","name":"阿米娅","text":"就好像......回到了最开始。","id":391,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/93/Avg_avg_1037_amiya3_1-6$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4179_monstr_1#2$1","id":392},{"type":"dialogue","name":"Mon3tr","text":"这件事不会那么简单，乌萨斯至今仍是一片对罗德岛而言充满了危险的地方。","id":393},{"type":"dialogue","name":"Mon3tr","text":"但是凯尔希在泰拉各地的办事处都留下了后手，当务之急是尽快恢复所有办事处之间的联络网。","id":394},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4179_monstr_1#1$1","id":395},{"type":"dialogue","name":"Mon3tr","text":"未来的行动，我们需要他们的帮助。","id":396,"end":true},{"type":"dialog","id":397},{"type":"charslot","id":398},{"type":"decision","options":{"1":{"id":"400","text":"需要先恢复与乌萨斯地区的联络渠道。"}},"values":[],"id":399},{"type":"predicate","references":["1"],"id":400},{"type":"decision","options":{"1":{"id":"402","text":"然后，我们会找到办法带回凯尔希。"}},"values":[],"id":401},{"type":"predicate","references":["1"],"id":402,"end":419},{"type":"stopmusic","fadetime":"3","id":403},{"type":"theater","mode":"true","id":404},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":405},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"3","block":"true","id":406},{"type":"charslot","id":407},{"type":"background","id":408},{"type":"image","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/e/e5/Avg_avg_ep15.png","screenadapt":"coverall","id":409},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":410},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"3","block":"true","id":411},{"type":"delay","time":"3","id":412},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":413},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":414},{"type":"theater","mode":"false","id":415},{"type":"image","id":416},{"type":"dialogue","name":"普瑞赛斯","text":"如今的泰拉，原来是这副模样。","id":417},{"type":"dialogue","name":"普瑞赛斯","text":"“科罗萨主矿脉”？原来那一颗源石现在被称为这个名字。","id":418},{"type":"dialogue","name":"普瑞赛斯","text":"嗯......也许它会是支撑下一步规划的合适选择。","id":419,"end":true},{"type":"dialog","id":420},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/1a/Avg_bg_60_g5_rhodesabyss_c.png","screenadapt":"coverall","id":421},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":422},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_labamb","loop":"true","channel":"a","volume":"0","id":423},{"type":"soundvolume","volume":"0.5","channel":"a","fadetime":"2","id":424},{"type":"playmusic","intro":"$darkness01_intro","key":"https://static.prts.wiki/music/music/beta1_180603/m_dia_darkness01_loop.mp3","volume":"0.6","id":425,"musicid":3},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":426},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_gen_walk_n","id":427},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1718_1#2$1","duration":"1.5","isblock":"true","id":428},{"type":"delay","time":"0.5","id":429},{"type":"dialogue","name":"普瑞赛斯","text":"源石的扩散程度已经远远低于了我们的预期，AMa-10也给我带来了不小的麻烦。","id":430,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/52/Avg_avg_npc_1718_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"普瑞赛斯","text":"我必须加快项目的进度了，时间真的已经所剩无几了。","id":431,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/52/Avg_avg_npc_1718_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1718_1#7$1","id":432},{"type":"dialogue","name":"普瑞赛斯","text":"这颗星球的演变，太慢了。","id":433,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/0e/Avg_avg_npc_1718_1-7$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"普瑞赛斯","text":"有必要启用其他更激进的手段——","id":434,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/0e/Avg_avg_npc_1718_1-7$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":435},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_gen_walk_n","volume":"1","id":436},{"type":"charslot","duration":"2","isblock":"true","id":437},{"type":"text","text":"她走进了已经封存在源石之中的Abyss更深处。","id":438},{"type":"dialog","id":439},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":440},{"type":"blocker","a":"0.6","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0.5","block":"true","id":441},{"type":"sticker","id":442,"multi":"true","text":"PRTS重启中......","x":"180","y":"170","alignment":"left","size":"24","delay":"0.04","width":"700","block":"true"},{"type":"playsound","key":"$alarmenter","volume":"0.8","id":443},{"type":"blocker","a":"0.3","r":"1","g":"0.2","b":"0.2","fadetime":"0.7","block":"true","id":444},{"type":"blocker","a":"0.4","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"1","block":"true","id":445},{"type":"sticker","id":446,"multi":"true","text":"\\n\\n重启失败。","block":"true"},{"type":"sticker","id":447,"multi":"true","text":"\\n\\n报错：核心代码缺失。","block":"true"},{"type":"sticker","id":448,"multi":"true","text":"\\n\\n报错：数据库缺失，无法检索。","block":"true"},{"type":"sticker","id":449,"duration":"0.5","block":"false"},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0.5","block":"true","id":450},{"type":"dialogue","name":"普瑞赛斯","text":"......暂时没办法借助PRTS来接入了。","id":451},{"type":"dialogue","name":"普瑞赛斯","text":"嗯，也许——","id":452},{"type":"dialog","id":453},{"type":"stopsound","channel":"a","fadetime":"2","id":454},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":455},{"type":"blocker","a":"0.6","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":456},{"type":"sticker","id":457,"multi":"true","text":"Dr.{@nickname}，现在的你并不理解自己正在做什么......","x":"250","y":"250","alignment":"center","duration":"1","size":"24","delay":"0.04","width":"800"},{"type":"sticker","id":458,"multi":"true","text":"\\n\\n我很遗憾你已经忘记了一切，我们迷失在宇宙中的探索，我们思维中共同锚定的销钉，我们长达万年的“辩论”。","block":"true"},{"type":"sticker","id":459,"multi":"true","text":"\\n\\n还有你最初对我许下的诺言......","block":"true"},{"type":"sticker","id":460,"duration":"0.5","block":"false"},{"type":"delay","time":"0.5","id":461},{"type":"sticker","id":462,"multi":"true","text":"时间是最残忍的迷宫，总是会令人迷失与分离。","x":"250","y":"250","alignment":"center","duration":"1","size":"24","delay":"0.04","width":"800"},{"type":"sticker","id":463,"multi":"true","text":"\\n\\n但我相信，我始终相信，你会重新认识这个宇宙的真相，认清我们必将面对的结局。","block":"true"},{"type":"sticker","id":464,"multi":"true","text":"\\n\\n我相信，到那个时候，你会回到我身边。","block":"true"},{"type":"sticker","id":465,"duration":"0.5","block":"false"},{"type":"delay","time":"0.5","id":466},{"type":"sticker","id":467,"text":"我会等你。","delay":"0.001","width":"800","x":"275","y":"330","duration":"2","alignment":"center","size":"24"},{"type":"sticker","id":468,"duration":"0.5","block":"false"},{"type":"delay","time":"0.2","id":469},{"type":"stopmusic","fadetime":"1","id":470},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_signlntrfrnc","volume":"1","id":471},{"type":"bgeffect","name":"$eb_signalInterference","layer":"1","id":472},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":473},{"type":"bgeffect","name":"$eb_glitch","layer":"2","id":474},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_oldtvelectricity","volume":"1","loop":"true","channel":"o","id":475},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":476},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_filmprojection","id":477},{"type":"stopsound","channel":"o","fadetime":"0.2","id":478},{"type":"stopsound","channel":"a","fadetime":"0.2","id":479},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0.2","block":"true","id":480},{"type":"bgeffect","id":481},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/e/e4/Avg_bg_bg_wilderness_m.png","screenadapt":"coverall","id":482},{"type":"delay","time":"3","id":483},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"3","block":"true","id":484},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":485},{"type":"playmusic","intro":"$plot_intro","key":"https://static.prts.wiki/music/music/act9d0d0/m_avg_plot_loop.mp3","volume":"0.6","id":486,"musicid":4},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_053","id":487},{"type":"dialogue","name":"萨卡兹佣兵","text":"你已经领着我们走很久了，萨科塔。","id":488,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/f5/Avg_avg_npc_053.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"萨卡兹佣兵","text":"怎么，什么时候开始，你们也想要赏金了？","id":489,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/f5/Avg_avg_npc_053.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":490},{"type":"charslot","id":491},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_gen_walk_n","id":492},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_355_1#2$1","duration":"1.5","isblock":"true","id":493},{"type":"delay","time":"0.5","id":494},{"type":"dialogue","name":"奥伦","text":"你的话太多了，萨卡兹。","id":495,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/00/Avg_avg_npc_355_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"奥伦","text":"从决定要对那帮无辜的叙拉古商队动手开始，你们的下场就注定了。","id":496,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/00/Avg_avg_npc_355_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"奥伦","text":"只是那里离卡兹戴尔的边境太近了。既然教宗也鼓励明面上的和平，我没有任何理由违反规定。","id":497,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/00/Avg_avg_npc_355_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_355_1#7$1","id":498},{"type":"dialogue","name":"奥伦","text":"到这就差不多了。","id":499,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/d4/Avg_avg_npc_355_1-7$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"奥伦","text":"要我说，你们离家太远了。","id":500,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/d4/Avg_avg_npc_355_1-7$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"奥伦","text":"佣兵，你们真应该缩在卡兹戴尔那个鬼地方永远也别出来。","id":501,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/d4/Avg_avg_npc_355_1-7$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_053","id":502},{"type":"dialogue","name":"萨卡兹雇佣兵","text":"啧。","id":503,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/f5/Avg_avg_npc_053.png"},{"type":"charslot","id":504},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_gunload","volume":"1","id":505},{"type":"text","text":"奥伦举起了铳。","id":506},{"type":"dialog","id":507},{"type":"camerashake","duration":"0.3","xstrength":"30","ystrength":"30","vibrato":"30","randomness":"90","fadeout":"true","block":"false","id":508},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":509},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_gunshot","volume":"1","id":510},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0.1","block":"true","id":511},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0.5","block":"true","id":512},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_bulletshtland","volume":"1","id":513},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":514},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_355_1#9$1","id":515},{"type":"dialogue","name":"奥伦","text":"......？","id":516,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/a/af/Avg_avg_npc_355_1-9$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_053","id":517},{"type":"dialogue","name":"萨卡兹雇佣兵","text":"......射、射偏了？","id":518,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/f5/Avg_avg_npc_053.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"萨卡兹雇佣兵","text":"你——你——","id":519,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/f5/Avg_avg_npc_053.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_355_1#7$1","id":520},{"type":"dialogue","name":"奥伦","text":"我不该手抖。","id":521,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/d4/Avg_avg_npc_355_1-7$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"奥伦","text":"你的确应该害怕我，萨卡兹。结束了。","id":522,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/d4/Avg_avg_npc_355_1-7$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_053","id":523},{"type":"dialogue","name":"萨卡兹雇佣兵","text":"等等！等等——","id":524,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/f5/Avg_avg_npc_053.png"},{"type":"camerashake","duration":"0.3","xstrength":"30","ystrength":"30","vibrato":"30","randomness":"90","fadeout":"true","block":"false","id":525},{"type":"dialogue","name":"萨卡兹雇佣兵","text":"你他妈到底是什么怪物！","id":526,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/f5/Avg_avg_npc_053.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":527},{"type":"charslot","id":528},{"type":"text","text":"奥伦有些疑惑地继续举着自己的铳，随后却震惊地从铳械的金属面上看到了自己......","id":529},{"type":"text","text":"他的光环正疯狂地闪烁。","id":530},{"type":"text","text":"恍惚中，倒映在铳械上的自己，与眼前将被处决的恶魔——","id":531},{"type":"text","text":"并无二致。","id":532},{"type":"dialog","id":533},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":534},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":535},{"type":"stopmusic","fadetime":"2","id":536},{"type":"charslot","id":537},{"type":"background","id":538},{"type":"image","id":539}],"characters":["热情的声音","阿兰娜","医疗干员","红","华法琳","希尔达","普瑞赛斯","远处的声音","采矿工人","急性感染的工人","阿米娅","Mon3tr","萨卡兹佣兵","奥伦","萨卡兹雇佣兵"]}